  "2026-08-30T17:52:36.175Z",pi-agent,"Findings 3890039791 and 3890050169 reproduced together: with only scanner source reverted, focused tests failed 2/2 (both retained actual --provenance), SOURCE_ONLY_REVERT_EXIT=1. Restored source passes. Added separated quoted-delimiter coverage to restore the unchanged 100% gate. npm test, coverage, docstring, and release:check pass after the final test addition."
